WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:03.560
Do you have to take blood pressure tablets for life?

00:04.060 --> 00:11.670
For most people, yes. High blood pressure is usually a long-term condition, so the tablets keep it under control.

00:12.170 --> 00:21.250
But less salt, more walking and losing extra weight can lower your blood pressure. Some people then need a smaller dose, or fewer tablets.

00:21.750 --> 00:30.360
Another myth: that taking them for years harms your body. These medicines are made for long-term use, and your doctor checks how you're doing.

00:30.860 --> 00:41.180
Never stop on your own. Your blood pressure can rise again within days. If you have side effects, talk to your doctor. There's often another option.
